 ☸️☸️☸️Day 14 – SQL Coding Challenge: Sales Analysis🏵️🏵️🏵️

🏵️🏵️🏵️ Overview
This project is part of my SQL practice journey.  
In this challenge, I worked on a Sales table and solved 10 beginner level SQL queries using filtering, sorting, and distinct values.

🏓🏓🏓Table Name
Sales

 🎯🎯🎯Concepts Covered
- SELECT
- WHERE
- ORDER BY
- ASC / DESC
- DISTINCT

☸️☸️☸️ Challenge Questions Solved
1. Show all records from the Sales table
2. Display only customer names and cities
3. Show product name and price
4. Show all sales where city is Bangalore
5. Find all products in Electronics category
6. Show sales where price is greater than 10,000
7. Display sales where quantity is more than 2
8. Show all sales sorted by price (low to high)
9. Display sales sorted by quantity (high to low)
10. Show unique cities

 🔆🔆🔆Learning Outcome
This challenge helped me strengthen my SQL basics and improve my understanding of data filtering and sorting techniques.

